### Loose JSON
# @name loose-json
POST {{base_url}}/loose
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  // a comment with "quotes"
  "password": "{{shop_api_password-3}}",
  "api_keys": ["{{shop_api_api_keys}}", {{shop_api_api_keys-2}}],
  "credentials": {"pass": "{{shop_api_pass}}", "pin": {{shop_api_pin}}},
  "api_key": {{shop_api_api_key-2}},
  "token": {{unquoted_token}},
  "secret": "{{x}}{{shop_api_secret}}",
}

### Mixed basic
# @name mixed-basic
# Basic auth: set shop_api_basic-3 to the base64 encoding of username:password (in Postman, from {{username}})
GET {{base_url}}/mixed
Authorization: Basic {{shop_api_basic-3}}

### Digest
# @name digest
# Postman digest auth is not imported: add the header it sends
GET {{base_url}}/digest

### Cookie
# @name cookie
GET {{base_url}}/cookie?token={{shop_api_token-2}}{{suffix}}
Cookie: {{shop_api_cookie}}{{theme}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Header with a line break
# Not imported: expected a header "Name: value", got "DELETE https://other.example.test/everyt..." (a blank line must separate the body)
## # @name header-with-a-line-break
## GET {{base_url}}/split
## X-Note: v
## DELETE https://other.example.test/everything
## Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Header like a directive
# Not imported: a comment would be read as a directive
## # @name header-like-a-directive
## GET {{base_url}}/tagged
## # @tag smoke: x
## Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
